{"availability":"available","full":"thuongtruong109/icoziv","name":"icoziv","description":"✨ Instantly flex your skills through edge-fast icons. Showcase skill icons into README profile. Alternative for skill.dev","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":28,"forks":9,"created":"2025-10-02T03:23:02Z","updated":"2026-10-04T11:34:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://thuongtruong109.github.io/icoziv","topics":["badges-markdown","github","github-profile","github-profile-readme","github-readme","icons","markdown","open-source","profile-readme","project","projects","readme","readme-profile","readme-stats"],"demo":"https://thuongtruong109.github.io/icoziv/#library","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.470Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.470Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.470Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.470Z","stars":28,"forks":9}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["We'd really appreciate it if you would consider starring our repository! It helps us gain visibility and support the project.","Icoziv is a fast, serverless service that generates beautiful skill and technology icon badges for your GitHub README files. Built for lightning-fast performance and global CDN distribution, it provides an easy way to showcase your tech stack with customizable themes and layouts.","Simply specify the technologies you use, and get a professional-looking SVG badge that automatically adapts to your README's theme."],"features":["Fast and Serverless: Built for speed and efficiency, leveraging serverless architecture for instant icon generation.","Global CDN & Smart Routing: Icons are served from Cloudflare's global CDN with Smart Placement for optimal edge routing and low latency worldwide.","Immutable Content: SVG icons are cached indefinitely with the immutable flag, ensuring unchanged assets are always served instantly from edge caches.","Stale-While-Revalidate: Stale content is served immediately while the cache updates in the background, minimizing latency on cache misses.","CDN-Friendly & Conditional Headers: Optimized for Cloudflare's CDN infrastructure with advanced cache-control, ETag, and If-None-Match support for efficient conditional requests (304 Not Modified)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thuongtruong109/icoziv/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b483d1ef1f692acbccc43f6717bd3f17aa8dfecfd5152183e6d3cb77d91485d7","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.560Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.560Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"We'd really appreciate it if you would consider starring our repository! It helps us gain visibility and support the project.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thuongtruong109/icoziv/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Icoziv is a fast, serverless service that generates beautiful skill and technology icon badges for your GitHub README files. Built for lightning-fast performance and global CDN distribution, it provides an easy way to showcase your tech stack with customizable themes and layouts.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thuongtruong109/icoziv/blob/main/README.md"},{"text":"Fast and Serverless: Built for speed and efficiency, leveraging serverless architecture for instant icon generation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thuongtruong109/icoziv/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b483d1ef1f692acbccc43f6717bd3f17aa8dfecfd5152183e6d3cb77d91485d7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thuongtruong109/icoziv/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.561Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T11:34:46Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/thuongtruong109/icoziv/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:56.566Z","hash":"b483d1ef1f692acbccc43f6717bd3f17aa8dfecfd5152183e6d3cb77d91485d7","originalBytes":53931,"storedBytes":53931,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["icoziv","skil